Table full name: HTAN_2.HTAN.SCRNASEQ_MSK_SCLC_COMBINED_SAMPLES_CURRENT
Column name: SEX Type: TEXT Description: Phenotypic sex
Column name: NGENES Type: NUMBER Description: Number of genes detected in a given cell
Column name: TREATMENT Type: TEXT Description: The type of treatment recieved by the patient
