Column name: LIBSIZE Type: FLOAT Description: Log (N+1) on the number of gene expression counts (reads mapped) for a given cell
Column name: TISSUE_ONTOLOGY_TERM_ID Type: TEXT Description: Uber-anatomy ontology ID (REF: https://www.ebi.ac.uk/ols/ontologies/uberon) (ex.UBERON:2001190)
Column name: IS_PRIMARY_DATA Type: BOOLEAN Description: Indicates if the sample is primary or not (True/False)
Column name: HTAN_BIOSPECIMEN_ID Type: TEXT Description: HTAN ID associated with a biosample based on HTAN ID SOP (eg HTANx_yyy_zzz)
Column name: DISEASE_ONTOLOGY_TERM_ID Type: TEXT Description: MONDO disease ontology ID (REF: https://www.ebi.ac.uk/ols/ontologies/mondo) (ex. MONDO:0100426 or PATO:0000461 for 'normal')
Column name: FEATURE_BIOTYPE Type: TEXT Description: Biological type of feature (e.g. gene)
Column name: ORGANISM_ONTOLOGY_TERM_ID Type: TEXT Description: NCBITaxon ID (REF: https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/taxonomy) (ex. NCBITaxon:9606 for human, NCBITaxon:10090 for mouse)
Column name: CELL_TYPE_MED Type: TEXT Description: Medium range cell type names, between coarse and fine.
Column name: SUSPENSION_TYPE Type: TEXT Description: Cell, nucleus, or na, as corresponding to sample preparation
Column name: HTAN_PARTICIPANT_ID Type: TEXT Description: HTAN ID associated with a patient based on HTAN ID SOP (eg HTANx_yyy )
Column name: PROCEDURE Type: TEXT Description: The method used in sampling the tumor, Biopsy or Resection
Column name: FEATURE_IS_FILTERED Type: BOOLEAN Description: Indicates if the feature (gene) was/should be filtered in analysis
Column name: FEATURE_NAME Type: TEXT Description: Gene name from HUGO Human Gene Nomenclature Committee (https://www.genenames.org/)
Column name: IOBS Type: NUMBER Description: Index to cell barcodes
Column name: CELL_TYPE_ONTOLOGY_TERM_ID Type: TEXT Description: Cell Ontology ID (i.e. CL:0000784)  (REF: https://www.ebi.ac.uk/ols/ontologies/cl)
Column name: CELL_TYPE_COARSE Type: TEXT Description: Coarse-grained cell labels
Column name: CELL_TYPE_FINE Type: TEXT Description: Fine-grained subclustering of cells
Column name: HISTO Type: TEXT Description: Histological cancer type
Column name: X_VALUE Type: FLOAT Description: Expression value for a given gene and cell
Column name: CELL_TYPE_GENERAL Type: TEXT Description: Broadly defined cell type compartments
Column name: ASSAY Type: TEXT Description: An assay based on 10X Genomics. Example : 100x3’ v2
Column name: TISSUE Type: TEXT Description: Derived from UBERON or CL terms that best describes the tissue that the cell was derived from.
Column name: ORGANISM Type: TEXT Description: The genus and species from which biosamples are derived
Column name: IVAR Type: NUMBER Description: Index to gene IDs
Column name: CLUSTERS Type: TEXT Description: Cluster labels assigned to each cell
Column name: DEVELOPMENT_STAGE_ONTOLOGY_TERM_ID Type: TEXT Description: Human Developmental Stages ID (REF: https://www.ebi.ac.uk/ols/ontologies/hsapdv) or Mouse Developmental Stages ID (REF: https://www.ebi.ac.uk/ols/ontologies/mmusdv) (HsapDv if human, MmusDv if mouse, unknown if information unavailable)
Column name: H_KNN Type: FLOAT Description: Entropy of samples represented in the kNN neighborhood of each cell (kNN=30)
Column name: RBP_FRAC Type: FLOAT Description: Percent of UMIs mapping to RNA-binding proteins (RBPs)
Column name: DONOR_ID Type: TEXT Description: Identifies a unique individual that data were derived from
Column name: SEX_ONTOLOGY_TERM_ID Type: TEXT Description: Phenotype And Trait Ontology ID, PATO:0000384 for male, PATO:0000383 for female, or unknown if unavailable
Column name: SELF_REPORTED_ETHNICITY_ONTOLOGY_TERM_ID Type: TEXT Description: If human, the Human Ancestry Ontology ID (i.e. HANCESTRO:0005) (REF: https://www.ebi.ac.uk/ols/ontologies/hancestro); "multiethnic" if more than one ethnicity. "Unknown" if human and no information, else "na" if non-human
Column name: FEATURE_REFERENCE Type: TEXT Description: A reference to the feature: NCBI Taxonomy ID
Column name: DISEASE Type: TEXT Description: Description of disease (example: lung adenocarcinoma) or normal cells
Column name: ASSAY_ONTOLOGY_TERM_ID Type: TEXT Description: Experimental Factor Ontology ID (REF: https://www.ebi.ac.uk/ols/ontologies/efo)
Column name: DEVELOPMENT_STAGE Type: TEXT Description: Human development stage derived from HsapDv term  (Example if data is Homo sapiens, development stage is obtained from Link. HsapDv:0000114 - 20-year-old human stage)
Column name: BATCH Type: TEXT Description: Sample ID
Column name: MITO_FRAC Type: FLOAT Description: Percent of UMIs mapping to mitochondrial genes
Column name: SELF_REPORTED_ETHNICITY Type: TEXT Description: Ethnicity of the individual (obtained from HANCESTRO terms for Homo sapiens)
